      "writtenOn": "2019-12-11T21:09:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How is this guaranteed to send an SOP\u0027 discover mode for TBT? The discover modes function will request the next SVID in the array, so there seems to be an assumption that other SVIDs can\u0027t exist on the port partner",
